  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kpTP23Fl\">相关链接：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-IHqznjWp\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-6v8Jyahs\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710749205519\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取RTA策略数据</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-9RxNL7QS\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710749917196\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取可用的RTA策略</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-W8PCA7wL\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1727976605031439\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">批量启停账户下RTA策略</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-s2r1eCBM\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1727976691326976\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">设置账户下RTA策略生效范围</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-tSENW8Em\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1738683217044484\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取穿山甲渠道RTA联合实验数据</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-dlKnZurz\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1743392244103246\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取站内媒体RTA联合实验数据（分时t+5）</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-bMfIWcaV\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1743460024243204\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取站内媒体RTA联合实验数据（分天t+1）</a></li></ul><hr style=\"background-color: rgb(232, 232, 232); border: 1px solid transparent; margin: 18px 0px;\"/><p data-id=\"p838747a-6myos0ek\">本篇主要介绍RTA策略，该功能为白名单功能，如需开通请联系对应销售同学。目前支持获取RTA策略数据、获取可用的RTA策略、批量启停账户下RTA策略、设置账户下RTA策略生效范围、获取穿山甲渠道RTA联合实验数据、获取站内媒体RTA联合实验数据（分时t+5）、获取站内媒体RTA联合实验数据（分天t+1）七个接口。</p><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-0bF9ORjn\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-z1wL7jOm\">什么是RTA？<br/>RTA产品定位：基于本地投放的程序化升级，根据客户不同的数据和技术能力，支持其逐步深入参与投放决策，最终共同优化提升营销投放效率/效果；<br/>Real Time API，作为一个有实时能力的api工具，基于目前投放系统 &amp; 模块中对实时性的要求切入营销投放各环节（实时筛选流量，替代DMP；实时过滤转化/调起去重，替代频控功能等）</li></ol></div>",
